# SwiftFormat enables a rule only when this version supports the syntax it
# writes. Xcode 27 ships Swift 6.4, but any value above 6.0 turns on
# trailingCommas and swiftTestingTestCaseNames, which rewrite about 670 files.
# Raise it together with that reformat, in a change of its own.
--swift-version 6.0
--indent tab
--tabwidth 4
# Matches line_length in .swiftlint.yml: the formatter wraps at this width and
# the linter rejects what it could not wrap.
--maxwidth 140
--wraparguments preserve
--wrapcollections preserve
